@context: Network — WAIT FOR RESPONSE against the real API — plus NEAR, FOR EACH over a list, and CALL HOST maths.
@title: catalog
@tags: regression, network
@var: {wanted} = Manul Plush, Snow Boots

STEP 1: Real API
    NAVIGATE to {base_url}/catalog.html
    VERIFY that 'Loaded 3 products' is present
    CLICK the 'Refresh catalog' button
    WAIT FOR RESPONSE "/api/products"
    VERIFY that 'Steppe Map' is present

STEP 2: Buy by name with NEAR
    FOR EACH {item} IN {wanted}:
        CLICK the 'Add to cart' button NEAR '{item}'
        PRINT "added {item}"
    VERIFY that 'Cart: 2' is present
    EXTRACT the 'Cart total' into {ui_total}
    CALL HOST demo.compute_total with args: "24.50" "89.99" into {expected_total}
    CALL HOST demo.assert_equal "{ui_total}" "{expected_total}"

STEP 3: Checkout hits the backend
    CLICK the 'Checkout' button
    VERIFY that 'placed' is present
    CALL HOST demo.api_order_count into {orders}
    PRINT "backend now has {orders} order(s)"

DONE.
